<title>UK: CPL Aromas warns on year profits.</title>
<headline>CPL Aromas warns on year profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>CPL Aromas Plc said on Friday that results for the year ending March 31, 1997 would be impacted by the strength of sterling and the poor performance of Du Crocq.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that results for the year will be below market expectations.</p>
</text>
